[00:00.00] 作词 : Zach Bryan
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Zach Bryan
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Zach Bryan
[00:13.04]Well, I ain't written a love song in so long as your hair leads down your spine
[00:13.04]我已许久未写情歌 久得像你发丝垂落脊背那么长
[00:19.84]But I don't mind if you last tonight, I'll regret it for the rest of time
[00:19.84]但我不在意 若你今夜留下 我将用余生时光追悔感伤
[00:25.88]Let your hips and your lips and your fingertips slip against the city streets
[00:25.88]任你腰肢 双唇 与指尖 沿都市街道悄然滑翔
[00:31.46]Seepin' in again, sleepin' in while my friends get high on the edge of the West Side Highway
[00:31.46]再度浸染 沉睡缠绵 而我的朋友们在西区高速边缘沉醉迷惘
[00:44.38]Did you ever make it back to Byron Bay the day you told me to quit drinkin'?
[00:44.38]你叫我戒酒那天 是否最终回到了拜伦湾
[00:50.35]And thinkin' that I was gonna die before thirty, your mom was so worried about
[00:50.35]想着自己活不过三十岁 你母亲曾为此忧心忡忡
[00:55.94]All those kids in the house tearin' picture frames down
[00:55.94]屋里那些孩子扯下相框
[00:59.20]Our fathers were never around when we were younger
[00:59.20]我们年少时 父亲总是不在身旁
[01:07.70]So let me go, I saw you on the river's edge
[01:07.70]所以放我走吧 我曾见你在河岸伫立
[01:12.56]Draggin' on a plastic cigarette
[01:12.56]抽着那支塑料香烟
[01:16.10]With your swim top still wet
[01:16.10]你的泳衣上摆依旧湿润
[01:20.10]So let it go, meetin' you out on the coast
[01:20.10]所以放下吧 在海滨与你相遇
[01:25.60]You hate the smell of real smoke
[01:25.60]你厌恶真实烟草的气味
[01:28.28]So why'd you always keep me so close?
[01:28.28]那为何总将我紧锁你身边
[01:40.08]You were collectin' shells out on the Bay Shore, you know I was a shell before?
[01:40.08]你在海湾收集贝壳 可知我也曾是空壳一具
[01:45.84]Deep in the hands of another, my brother
[01:45.84]深陷他人掌心 我的兄弟
[01:48.54]Had told me to leave, but I didn't believe
[01:48.54]曾劝我离开 我却不信
[01:51.92]That evil would mean some people you meet out in Queens
[01:51.92]所谓邪恶竟会是皇后区遇见的某些身影
[01:59.06]The way the rain came down the other day in Bryon Bay
[01:59.06]那天拜伦湾的雨倾泻而下
[02:03.82]Made me feel so alone, so I just went home
[02:03.82]让我感到如此孤寂 于是我独自归家
[02:07.08]And scribbled some poem
[02:07.08]潦草写下几行诗句
[02:08.92]That I know that you'll never read
[02:08.92]明知你永远不会阅读的心事
[02:16.10]So let it go, I saw you on the river's edge
[02:16.10]所以放下吧 我曾见你在河岸伫立
[02:20.76]Draggin' on a plastic cigarette
[02:20.76]抽着那支塑料香烟
[02:24.30]With your swim top still wet
[02:24.30]你的泳衣上端依然湿润
